# Saheeli, the Sun's Brilliance ("{U}{R}, {T}: Create a token that's a copy of another target creature or artifact you control, except it's an
# artifact in addition to its other types. It gains haste. Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step."). Turn 1: Bot1 casts Saheeli and
# Grizzly Bears. Turn 3: Saheeli, no longer summoning sick, can target neither herself ("another"), nor Bot2's Memnite, nor nothing at all
# (CR 115.1); it copies Grizzly Bears: the token is an artifact creature with haste (CR 707.9b, 613.1f), so it attacks the turn it arrives while
# the original, cast last turn, may too; Saheeli taps for the cost and the token is sacrificed at the beginning of the end step (CR 603.7c),
# leaving the original. The cost {U}{R}, {T} is paid exactly.

